# A report export drawn as a sequence diagram: the user starts an export job, a worker builds the file
# while the browser polls the status twice, then the browser downloads the finished file from storage.
diagram sequence
title Export job with polling
user[User] -> api[API] : POST /exports
api -> queue[Job Queue]{shape: queue} : enqueue export
api --> user : 202 job id
queue -> worker[Worker] : run job @2s
loop 2
  wait 0.5
  user -> api : GET /exports/42
  api --> user : running
end
worker -> store[File Storage]{shape: db} : upload report.csv
user -> api : GET /exports/42
api --> user : done + URL
user -> store : download
store --> user : report.csv
